## Troubleshooting

### Tests Not Running
- Verify file naming: `*.test.ts(x)`
- Check vitest config in `vitest.config.ts`
- Ensure setup file exists

### DOM Not Available
- Use `happy-dom` environment (default)
- Check setupFiles are loaded
- Verify jsdom/happy-dom installed

### Async Timeouts
- Use `waitFor()` with higher timeout: `waitFor(() => {...}, { timeout: 5000 })`
- Verify API mocks are set up
- Check for race conditions

### Coverage Low
- Add tests for untested branches
- Use `pnpm test --coverage` to find gaps
- Test error cases and edge cases
